                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <input name="column" type="text" placeholder="Column" size="6"/>
                                    <label for="column">Column:</label>
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </fieldset>
                    </form>
                </div>
                <div id="dialog-templates">
                    <p>Create a new document by selecting a mode below. If templates are defined for this mode,
                            a second select will appear to choose a template from. If you do not want to use a template,
                            leave it to "None".</p>
                    <form>
                        <fieldset>
                            <ol>
                                <li>
                                    <select class="type-select" name="type">
                                        <option value="css">CSS</option>
                                        <option value="html">HTML</option>
                                        <option value="javascript">Javascript</option>
                                        <option value="json">JSON</option>
                                        <option value="less">Less</option>
                                        <option value="markdown">Markdown</option>
                                        <option value="text">Text</option>
                                        <option value="xml">XML</option>
                                        <option value="xquery" selected="selected">XQuery</option>
                                    </select>
                                    <label for="type">Type:</label>
                                </li>
                                <li class="templates">
                                    <select name="template">
                                        <option value="">None</option>
                                    </select>
                                    <label for="template">Template:</label>
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </fieldset>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div id="dialog-startup">
                <h1>Getting Help</h1>
                <p>
                    eXide has many features. Make sure you read the
                    <a href="https://github.com/eXist-db/eXide#readme" target="_new">documentation</a>
                to understand code completion, refactorings, and keyboard shortcuts.</p>
            </div>
            <div id="dialog-git-checkout">
                <p>Checkout git working directory to another branch</p>
                <form>
                    <fieldset>
                        <ol>
                            <li>
                                <div class="hint">Select a new branch</div>
                                <select name="git-checkout" id="git-checkout-select">
                                    <option value="noValue">noValue</option>
                                </select>
                                <label for="git-checkout">checkout to branch:</label>
                            </li>
                        </ol>
                    </fieldset>
                    <input type="hidden" name="git-command" value="checkout"/>
                    <div id="git-checkout-status"/>
                </form>
            </div>
            <div id="dialog-git-commit">
                <p>Sync with the git working directory and run a git commit once done</p>
                <form>
                    <fieldset>
                        <ol>
                            <li>
                                <div class="hint">Start date/time in xs:dateTime notation. Only resources modified after this date will
                              be synchronized. This field is filled automatically from the application descriptor
                              (if available).</div>
                                <input type="dateTime" name="start" size="36"/>
                                <label for="start">Start time:</label>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="hint">title (first line) for the commit message</div>
                                <input name="git-commit-title" required="required" size="36"/>
                                <label for="git-commit-title">title:</label>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="hint">commit description</div>
                                <textarea name="git-commit-desc" rows="4" cols="35"/>
                                <label for="git-commit-desc">description:</label>
                            </li>
                        </ol>
                    </fieldset>
                    <input type="hidden" name="git-command" value="commit"/>
                    <div id="git-commit-status"/>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="directory-context-menu" class="directory-context-menu">
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="new-collection"><i class="fa fa-folder"/>New Collection</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="new-resource"><i class="fa fa-file"/>New Resource</div>
            <div class="ctx-separator"/>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="upload"><i class="fa fa-upload"/>Upload Files</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="download"><i class="fa fa-download"/>Download</div>
            <div class="ctx-separator"/>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="rename"><i class="fa fa-pencil"/>Rename</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="delete"><i class="fa fa-trash"/>Delete</div>
            <div class="ctx-separator"/>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="copy-path"><i class="fa fa-clipboard"/>Copy Path</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="properties"><i class="fa fa-info"/>Properties</div>
            <div class="ctx-separator"/>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="reload"><i class="fa fa-refresh"/>Reload</div>
        </div>
        <div id="browse-context-menu" class="directory-context-menu">
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="open"><i class="fa fa-folder-open"/>Open</div>
            <div class="ctx-separator"/>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="create"><i class="fa fa-folder-o"/>New Collection</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="upload"><i class="fa fa-upload"/>Upload Files</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="download"><i class="fa fa-download"/>Download</div>
            <div class="ctx-separator"/>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="rename"><i class="fa fa-pencil"/>Rename</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="copy"><i class="fa fa-copy"/>Copy</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="cut"><i class="fa fa-cut"/>Cut</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="paste"><i class="fa fa-paste"/>Paste</div>
            <div class="ctx-separator"/>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="delete"><i class="fa fa-trash"/>Delete</div>
            <div class="ctx-separator"/>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="copy-path"><i class="fa fa-clipboard"/>Copy Path</div>
            <div class="ctx-item" data-action="properties"><i class="fa fa-info"/>Properties</div>
        </div>
    <script type="text/javascript" src="resources/scripts/ui-init.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
